# Subagents — never use (global)

Do **not** use the Task tool or any subagent workflow for this project:

- No explore / generalPurpose / debug / computerUse / videoReview subagents
- No parallel or background subagents
- No single subagent “to speed things up”

Work directly: Grep, Read, Shell, edit files, run tests/build yourself.

If a task feels large, break it into steps in the main thread — do not spawn subagents.
